(126, 'Tech Lead – Cloud (H/ F) | Rabat (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-tech-lead-cloud-h-f-recrutement-confidentiel-rabat-166290.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-12-23', '2025-01-14', NULL, NULL, '', 'For one of our projects we\'re hiring a Tech Lead – Cloud (H/ F) who will join the IAAS Product Quality Assurance Team.', 'Implication au travail Besoin d\'autonomie Besoin de réflexion Ambition Recherche de nouveauté', 'Maroc', '1 poste(s) sur Rabat et région', 'Informatique / Electronique - Secteur Informatique', 'Informatique / Electronique', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +5 et plus', 'De 5 à 10 ans', 'University degree (engineer profile) with Proven work experience in software quality assurance (at least 6 -8 years), Must exhibit a strong knowledge of software QA methodologies, tools, and processes (ISTQB certification is highly recommended), Experience working in an Agile/Scrum development process., Have experience in JIRA, Confluence and Github., Proven ability to thrive in a matrixed, multi-cultural and global environment., Good knowledge and hands-on experiences in the Cloud, ideally for both provider AWS and AZURE for infrastructure resources such as servers, storage, network, database, cloud security, PaaS, etc, Knowledge and experience on GitHub Actions, TerraGrunt, TerraTest, AWS SDK,Azure Goland SDK, Requires good understanding of the Quality assurance best practices with a good level of expertise (ISTQB certification is highly desired), Hands-on experience with automated testing tools and technologies knowledge (Java, Spring, Selenium, Testing, Maven, - or similar), Terraform knowledge.', 'Implication au travail, Besoin d\'autonomie, Besoin de réflexion, Ambition, Recherche de nouveauté, Implication au travail, Besoin d\'autonomie, Besoin de réflexion, Ambition, Recherche de nouveauté', NULL, 'Implication au travail, Besoin d\'autonomie, Besoin de réflexion, Ambition, Recherche de nouveauté, Implication au travail, Besoin d\'autonomie, Besoin de réflexion, Am