(192, 'TECHNICIEN Spécialisé dans la fabrication des gaine en tole galvanisé', 'https://marocemploi.net/offre/technicien-specialise-dans-la-fabrication-des-gaine-en-tole-galvanise/', 'Maroc Emploi', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '@ ELESI', NULL, 'Entreprise a Agadir cherche une technicien spécialisé dans la fabrication des conduits rectangulaires agrafes avec des machine. Avoir une expérience dans le domaine min 4 ans.', NULL, 'Rabat, Rabat, 10160', 'Industrie', NULL, 'CDD', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'bac +2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(193, 'QHSE Engineer', 'https://marocemploi.net/offre/qhse-engineer/', 'Maroc Emploi', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '@ MOROCCO PRECISION MOULDING', NULL, 'Job advert: QHSE Engineer About the Role We are seeking a Quality, Health & Safety and Environmental (QHSE) Engineer to join our organisation permanently at our Morocco site (MPM- Fibrax Morocco). Reporting to the site Compliance Manager, the QHSE Engineer will be responsible for the proper application of quality, health, safety and environmental (QHSE) standards within the organisation. This role involves providing support to customers and ensuring the claim analysis and corrective actions implementation follow up within the due dates and achieve quality targets of the Fibrax group of companies. Key responsibilities include: Management of customers claims including Fulfilment of customer portals and manage meetings with customers. Manage the Company’s Non-conformance Reporting System and ensure that root causes are identified, and robust corrective actions implemented to prevent recurrence Ensure that all nonconforming products is properly dispositioned & root cause analysis is performed in line with company procedures (8D,5Whys, Ishikawa…). Management of suppliers claims and PPAP documentation Follow up quality action plans and ensure they are carried out as required. Assistance with both internal and external audits of the compliance management systems. Provision of guidance to relevant departments in the development of process and other improvement programmes. Collaborate with cross-functional teams from different departments to meet quality objectives. Identification of trainings needed for employees regarding customer special characteristics as well as HSE and legal characteristics. Other relevant tasks are requested from time to time. About the Person The successful candidate will be in a quality role and will have established problem solving and communication skills, including managing conflict and facilitating discussions to achieve a constructive outcome. Persistence, organisation, an eye for detail, and the ability to process and prioritise complex information are also key skills. An engineering degree is required. Knowledge/Experience: At least 2 years of experience in a similar role within a manufacturing environment, with a strong focus on process improvement and product quality. Preferably from the automotive industry. Comprehensive understanding of quality management systems and standards such as ISO9001, IATF 16949, and ISO14001. A background in engineering, science, or a related technical field is preferred. Familiarity with Six Sigma, LEAN manufacturing principles, and quality improvement methodologies is beneficial. Solid experience using quality tools such as FMEA, Control Plans, SPC and MSA to drive process optimization and product quality. Strong problem-solving skills with the ability to conduct investigations, identify root causes, and implement corrective actions to prevent recurrence. Excellent communication skills with the ability to work cross-functionally and with customers to resolve quality issues. Attention to detail, critical thinking, and the ability to manage multiple tasks in a fastpaced environment. Strong verbal and written communication skills in English (additional languages are a plus). Proficient in Microsoft Office applications (Excel, Word, PowerPoint) and quality software/tools. About Fibrax Group Fibrax Limited was established in London in 1902 as a manufacturer of bicycle clutch and brake linings. The company enjoyed steady growth and was bought by the current owners, the O’Brien family, in 1975 with a vision to expand and move into new industrial markets. As the cycling division extended its product range, new opportunities simultaneously arose in the automotive and industrial sectors, which resulted in the company investing in new manufacturing headquarters in Wrexham, North Wales. By 1985, Fibrax was operating as a highly successful rubber and plastics injection moulding company supplying quality components worldwide. With the rise of global demand, our facility in Wrexham underwent several extensions to accommodate new equipment. In 2004, we acquired a new, state-of-the-art manufacturing facility in Poland and have since forged production partnerships in Morocco and Turkey. In 2018, we acquired a new manufacturing facility in Berrechid-Morocco. Looking ahead, to enhance operational efficiency and better serve our expanding customer base, we are excited to announce that the facility in Morocco will be transferred to a newly built facility being developed in Kenitra Atlantic Freezone. As a family-owned business, we know our people are critical to the success of our continued growth. We therefore support our employees by providing regular training and opportunities for development. By combining their knowledge and understanding with our latest equipment and machinery, we are able to consistently produce high performance components. As such, Fibrax operates as a highly responsive, full service global manufacturer of polymeric mouldings and assemblies. About the Benefits In addition to a competitive salary depends on experience, you will have access to the following benefits: CIMR. Flexible working hours with flexi time options. Bonuses depend on site evolution. Private medical insurance. Salary development based on performance. If you’re seeking a challenging and rewarding career as part of an extraordinary business with ambitious plans, then what are you waiting for? Apply now. Closing date is 02/01/2025- may close before if high volume applications are received.', NULL, 'Berrechid, Berrechid, 20150', 'Automobile', NULL, 'CDI', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Voir Job Description', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(194, 'Commerciale', 'https://marocemploi.net/offre/commerciale/', 'Maroc Emploi', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '@ ELESI', NULL, 'Société a Rabat cherche une commerciale expérimenté bac+2 avec une expérience dans le domaine de 4 ans.', NULL, 'Rabat, Rabat, 10160', 'Commerces / distribution', NULL, 'CDD', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'bac+2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(195, 'Ingénieur Fluid', 'https://marocemploi.net/offre/ingenieur-fluid/', 'Maroc Emploi', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '@ ELESI', NULL, 'Société a rabat recherche une ingénieur Fluid ou énergétique capable de de faire les études et le suivi des projets CVC Plomberie désenfumage…. Avec une expérience min 2 ans', NULL, 'Rabat, Rabat, 10160', 'Construction', NULL, 'CDD', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ingénieur Fluid', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(196, 'Métreurs', 'https://marocemploi.net/offre/metreurs/', 'Maroc Emploi', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '@ TRPMA', NULL, 'Nous sommes un bureau d’études spécialisé dans la construction de bâtiments publics. Dans le cadre de notre expansion nous recherchons des métreurs gros-oeuvre, ravalement et métallerie. Il s’agit de répondre à des appels d’offres pour des marchés publics. Une expérience de 3 années au même poste serait appréciée. La maîtrise de la langue française est indispensable. Les postes sont basés à Marrakech. Vous voudrez bien envoyer votre CV à trp94.ao@gmail.com', NULL, 'Marrakech, Marrakech, 40000', 'Construction', NULL, 'CDI', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AUTOCAD', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(197, 'Délégués Médicaux', 'https://marocemploi.net/offre/delegues-medicaux/', 'Maroc Emploi', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '@ Cospharma', NULL, 'Dans le cadre de son développement, le Laboratoire Cospharma recherche ses futurs délègues médicaux dans les villes suivantes : Casablanca, Rabat, Fès-Meknès, Marrakech, Tanger, Agadir et Oujda. Vous êtes un délégué médical confirmé, vous avez l’âme d’un commercial et souhaitez rejoindre une équipe dynamique, postulez dès maintenant. Nous offrons un salaire motivant, des avantages sociaux, des Indemnités de déplacements et des Incentives. Postulez à l’adresse suivante : promotion@cospharma.ma', NULL, 'Casablanca, Casablanca, 20150', 'Santé / médical / social', NULL, 'CDI', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(198, 'Responsable Administratif et Financier Comptable (H/F)', 'https://marocemploi.net/offre/responsable-administratif-et-financier-comptable-h-f/', 'Maroc Emploi', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '@ NAM GESTION TRUCKS', NULL, 'Notre société, spécialisée dans la gestion administrative externalisée, recherche un(e) Responsable Administratif et Financier Comptable pour rejoindre notre équipe dynamique et contribuer à la gestion de nos clients. Missions : Préparation des documents comptables : Collecte, vérification et préparation des pièces justificatives nécessaires à la comptabilité (factures, relevés bancaires, etc.). Gestion administrative des documents : Traitement des courriers, classement, archivage et gestion des documents officiels, avec un suivi rigoureux. Vous serez responsable de la coordination des missions administratives pour le compte de nos clients, avec un suivi et un reporting réguliers. Déclarations fiscales et sociales : Préparation des déclarations fiscales (TVA, impôts sur les sociétés, etc.) et sociales. Relation avec les clients et les partenaires : Vous assurerez un suivi quotidien auprès des clients et des interlocuteurs externes (banques, organismes sociaux, etc.). Exigences du poste : Formation : Bac+5 en comptabilité, gestion, ou finance. Expérience : 3 à 5 ans d’expérience sur un poste similaire, idéalement dans un environnement de gestion externalisée ou en cabinet. Compétences requises : Maîtrise des outils comptables et bureautiques (Excel, logiciels de comptabilité). Rigueur, organisation et capacité à travailler de manière autonome. Sens du service client et capacité à répondre aux attentes des clients avec réactivité et professionnalisme. Lieu : Tanger Disponibilité : Immédiate Pour postuler, veuillez envoyer votre CV et lettre de motivation à l’adresse suivante : nam.comptabilite@gmail.com', NULL, 'Tanger, Tanger, 90000', 'Services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(199, 'Assistant Marketing', 'https://marocemploi.net/offre/assistant-marketing/', 'Maroc Emploi', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '@ Atlas nord', NULL, 'Nous sommes à la recherche d’un assistant marketing. Participation aux salons et exhibitions internationaux, gestion des relations clients, préparation de l’identité visuelle, mise à jour du site web et création du contenu, suivi des opération d’exports. BAC+3 ou plus Minimum 2 ans d’expériences', NULL, 'Agadir, Agadir, 80000', 'Industrie', NULL, 'CDI', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
