 of a team., Knowledge of relevant industry regulations and best practices., Ability to maintain confidentiality and handle sensitive information appropriately., Strong time management and multitasking abilities., Full-time, with occasional travel to company locations., Office environment with flexible work options where applicable., Successful completion of audits on time and within budget., Timeliness and quality of audit reports., Effectiveness of recommendations in improving internal controls and reducing risks., Positive feedback from management and department heads regarding audit insights and recommendations.', 'Organisation, Besoin de réflexion, Flexibilité, Conventionnel, Rationalisme, Distance émotionnelle, Extraversion, Organisation, Besoin de réflexion, Flexibilité, Conventionnel, Rationalisme, Distance émotionnelle, Extraversion', NULL, 'Organisation, Besoin de réflexion, Flexibilité, Conventionnel, Rationalisme, Distance émotionnelle, Extraversion, Organisation, Besoin de réflexion, Flexibilité, Conventionnel, Rationalisme, Distance émotionnelle, Extraversion', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hybride'),
