(599, 'Accountant - Treasury | Casablanca (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-accountant---treasury-recrutement-air-arabia-casablanca-166961.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-12-12', '2025-02-12', 'Morocco Morocco', NULL, 'Air Arabia', 'Air Arabia (PJSC), listed on the Dubai Financial Market, is the Middle East and North Africa’s first and leading low-cost carrier flying to over 150 destinations across the world. Air Arabia was the first airline to introduce the low-cost carrier concept in the region and is on a mission to serve all Arab countries and beyond, constantly undergoing aggressive route expansion, taking advantage of its ideally located hubs in the United Arab Emirates, Morocco and Egypt. Over the past years, Air Arabia, through continuous market research and customer feedback, has provided a range of value added services to millions of passengers who chose to fly with the airline\'s fleet of A320 aircraft. The airline commenced operations in October 2003 and achieved financial break-even from its very first year of services and has been profitable ever since. The airline commenced operations in October 2003 and achieved financial break-even from its very first year of services and has been profitable ever since. -\nCompany Presentation:\nAir Arabia Maroc is part of the Air Arabia Group. Based in Casablanca, Air Arabia Maroc is Morocco\'s leading Low Cost Carrier (LCC). Focusing on an offer that combines comfort, reliability and excellent value for money, the airline was established in April 2009.\nCompany address: 04 Rue Carthage, Quartier les Iris, Casablanca\nCompany name: Air Arabia Maroc\nIndustry: Airline company\nCompany Video Links: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nXcaeHzMwgs', 'Respect des règles Rationalisme Conventionnel Besoin d\'objectivité Organisation', 'Maroc', '1 poste(s) sur Casablanca et région', 'Gestion / Comptabilité / Finance - Secteur Aéronautique / Spatial - Banque / Finance', 'Gestion / Comptabilité / Finance', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +3', 'De 3 à 5 ans', 'Bachelor degree in Accounting /Finance/ Commerce or equivalent from a recognized university is a must., Chartered Accountant/Certified Professional Accountant or Fresh Graduate/MBA Finance is an advantage., Proficient in Microsoft Office- Advanced Excel, Access, Word, Power Point skills, Internet and Web Search., Cost Control, Compliance, Budgeting and Auditing certificates and trainings are an added value and some may be treated as conditional for this role., Fluent in French and English Language., Moroccan Nationality is a must, 3-5 years of comprehensive working experience in treasury/cash management role in any industry with a company operating on regional/multinational level, preferably in Airline or Banking sectors., Experience with Low Cost Airline is considered an advantage., Experienced in a computerized accounting environment is essential for this role., Sound knowledge of accounting cycle, process flow and procedures is a pre-requisite., Possesses comprehensive knowledge in accounting fundamentals and systems such as SFAS (Statements of Financial Accounting Concepts)., Previous working experience on negotiating and preparation of Fuel Contracts would be an advantage., Very good exposure on financial models and new technologies in the industry., Strong math and numerical reasoning ability and high accuracy are mandatory for this role., Excellent financial, analytical and reporting skills., Capable of meeting deadlines without compromising quality of outcome., High attention to details, confidentiality, and ability to adhere to procedures and set measures are a must.', 'Respect des règles, Rationalisme, Conventionnel, Besoin d\'objectivité, Organisation, Respect des règles, Rationalisme, Conventionnel, Besoin d\'objectivité, Organisation', NULL, 'Respect des règles, Rationalisme, Conventionnel, Besoin d\'objectivité, Organisation, Respect des règles, Rationalisme, Conventionnel, Besoin d\'objectivité, Organisation', NULL, NULL, NULL,