trends and potential opportunities., Lead and inspire team members to enhance employee engagement and cultivate a high-performing management and operations., Oversee all operations and business activities, ensuring they yield desired results efficiently and align with the overarching strategy and mission of ACME., Foster a culture of innovation, collaboration, and excellence among the ACME’s staff., Act as the public face of ACME, representing its mission and values to external audiences., Review financial and technical outcomes of the centre’s activities to identify opportunities for improvement and devise strategic solutions., Make informed and impactful investment decisions to propel the business forward and enhance profitability., Commitment to promoting diversity, equity, and inclusion within the organization., Ensure adherence to legal guidelines and in-house policies, safeguarding the company\'s legality and upholding the highest standards of business ethics., Proven Executive Leadership: Demonstrated leadership with over 15 years of proven experience in executive managerial positions, showcasing a track record of driving organizational success., Demonstrated leadership with over 15 years of proven experience in executive managerial positions, showcasing a track record of driving organizational success., Industry Expertise: Preferably, a background in the automotive, aeronautic or other advanced engineering sector., Preferably, a background in the automotive, aeronautic or other advanced engineering sector., Business Development and Sales Acumen: Preferred experience in business development and technical sales, underscoring a strategic approach to driving revenue growth and market expansion. Demonstrated ability to raise funds and secure partnerships in business., Preferred experience in business development and technical sales, underscoring a strategic approach to driving revenue growth and market expansion., Demonstrated ability to raise funds and secure partnerships in business., New Business Launch and Growth Strategy: Successful experience in launching new businesses or business units and crafting comprehensive growth strategies to ensure sustainable development., Successful experience in launching new businesses or business units and crafting comprehensive growth strategies to ensure sustainable development., Entrepreneurial Mindset: An entrepreneurial and visionary mindset coupled with outstanding organizational and leadership skills, fostering innovation and agility., An entrepreneurial and visionary mindset coupled with outstanding organizational and leadership skills, fostering innovation and agility., Business and Financial Acumen: Familiarity with diverse business functions including marketing, public relations, finance, and other operational areas. Strong comprehension of corporate finance and adeptness in performance management principles. In-depth knowledge of corporate governance and proficiency in implementing general management best practices to ensure organizational effectiveness., Familiarity with diverse business functions including marketing, public relations, finance, and other operational areas., Strong comprehension of corporate finance and adeptness in performance management principles., In-depth knowledge of corporate governance and proficiency in implementing general management best practices to ensure organizational effectiveness., Analytical and Problem-Solving Abilities: Demonstrated analytical abilities and problem-solving skills., Demonstrated analytical abilities and problem-solving skills., Effective Communication: Excellent communication in French and English. Strong negotiation and relationship-building skills. Strong public speaking skills, facilitating transparent communication with internal and external stakeholders., Excellent communication in French and English. Strong negotiation and relationship-building skills., Strong public speaking skills, facilitating transparent communication with internal and external stakeholders., Qualifications: MSc/MA in Business Administration or a relevant field (EMBA is preferred) Bachelor degree in Engineering (Diplome d’ingénieur d’état d’une grande école d’ingénieurs is preferred), MSc/MA in Business Administration or a relevant field (EMBA is preferred), Bachelor degree in Engineering (Diplome d’ingénieur d’état d’une grande école d’ingénieurs is preferred)', 'Flexibilité, Extraversion, Organisation, Rationalisme, Implication au travail, Flexibilité, Extraversion, Organisation, Rationalisme, Implication au travail', NULL, 'Flexibilité, Extraversion, Organisation, Rationalisme, Implication au travail, Flexibilité, Extraversion, Organisation, Rationalisme, Implication au travail', 'Strategic Vision and Profitable Strategy Development: Proven expertise in developing profitable strategies and implementing visionary initiatives to enhance organizational performance., Proven expertise in developing profitable strategies and implementing visionary initiatives to enhance organizational performance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Non'),
