(980, 'Research Assistant: Developing Sustainable Adsorption Solutions for Environmental Remediation | Benguerir (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-research-assistant-developing-sustainable-adsorption-solutions-for-environmental-remediation-recrutement-um6p---universite-mohammed-vi-polytechnique-benguerir-166574.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-26', '2025-01-26', 'Lot 660, Hay Moulay Rachid, Ben Guerir 43150', NULL, 'UM6P - Université Mohammed VI Polytechnique', 'Mohammed VI Polytechnic University is an institution dedicated to research and innovation in Africa and aims to position itself among world-renowned universities in its fields The University is engaged in economic and human development and puts research and innovation at the forefront of African development. A mechanism that enables it to consolidate Morocco’s frontline position in these fields, in a unique partnership-based approach and boosting skills training relevant for the future of Africa. Located in the municipality of Benguerir, in the very heart of the Green City, Mohammed VI Polytechnic University aspires to leave its mark nationally, continentally, and globally.', 'Recherche de nouveauté Ambition Besoin d\'action Besoin d\'autonomie Rationalisme', 'Maroc', '1 poste(s) sur Marrakech et région', 'Gestion projet / Etudes / R&D - Secteur Enseignement / Formation', 'Gestion projet / Etudes / R&D', 'CDD', NULL, 'Bac +5 et plus', 'De 3 à 5 ans', 'Synthesis and functionalization of bio-based materials (biopolymer-based adsorbents) for continuous adsorptive applications., Design and conduct experiments to evaluate the performance of these materials in real-world environmental and energy-related challenges (e.g., contaminant capture, and adsorption processes)., Optimize the fabrication methods and scale-up processes for practical and industrial applications., Participate in laboratory research, analyzing data, interpreting results, and contributing to scientific publications and presentations., Collaborate with team members on interdisciplinary research projects and actively contribute to discussions on improving materials\' efficiency and sustainability.', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin d\'action, Besoin d\'autonomie, Rationalisme, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin d\'action, Besoin d\'autonomie, Rationalisme', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin d\'action, Besoin d\'autonomie, Rationalisme, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin d\'action, Besoin d\'autonomie, Rationalisme', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Non'),
(981, 'Research Assistants in Extraction and Purification technologies (CDD of 1 year) | Benguerir (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-research-assistants-in-extraction-and-purification-technologies-cdd-of-1-year-recrutement-um6p---universite-mohammed-vi-polytechnique-benguerir-166575.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-26', '2025-01-26', 'Lot 660, Hay Moulay Rachid, Ben Guerir 43150', NULL, 'UM6P - Université Mohammed VI Polytechnique', 'Mohammed VI Polytechnic University is an institution dedicated to research and innovation in Africa and aims to position itself among world-renowned universities in its fields The University is engaged in economic and human development and puts research and innovation at the forefront of African development. A mechanism that enables it to consolidate Morocco’s frontline position in these fields, in a unique partnership-based approach and boosting skills training relevant for the future of Africa. Located in the municipality of Benguerir, in the very heart of the Green City, Mohammed VI Polytechnic University aspires to leave its mark nationally, continentally, and globally.', 'Recherche de nouveauté Ambition Besoin d\'action Besoin d\'autonomie Rationalisme', 'Maroc', '1 poste(s) sur Marrakech et région', 'Gestion projet / Etudes / R&D - Secteur Enseignement / Formation', 'Gestion projet / Etudes / R&D', 'CDD', NULL, 'Bac +5 et plus', 'De 3 à 5 ans', 'Collaborate with senior researchers and multidisciplinary teams to achieve project objectives., Document research findings, assist in preparing scientific publications, and present results at conferences., Support the training and supervision of junior researchers and students involved in related projects.', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin d\'action, Besoin d\'autonomie, Rationalisme, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin d\'action, Besoin d\'autonomie, Rationalisme', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin d\'action, Besoin d\'autonomie, Rationalisme, Recherch