(1086, 'Production Trainer | Nador (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-production-trainer-recrutement-aeolon-technology-co.ltd-nador-166441.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-21', '2025-01-21', 'Zone d\'accélération industrielle de BETOYA, Nador, MAROC Nador', NULL, 'Aeolon Technology co.,Ltd', 'Aeolon Technology Co., Ltd. is a leading professional manufacturer of wind power blades. At present, the company has provided innovative technology and product solutions for wind turbine operators and wind farms in many countries and regions around the world, providing high-quality, cost-effective products and customized quality services for global users. Founded in 2007, the company has set up production bases in many cities in China and in other countries (Shanghai, Jiangsu, Hebei, Gansu, Inner Mongolia, Morocco) and a R&D center in Germany. We are a leading global blade R&D, production, sales and O&M service company.\nWe are committed to the field of wind power blades, grasp the opportunity of the rapid development of the wind power industry, taking on the historical and environmental protection responsibility, focus on product quality and efficiency, striving to promote the development of clean energy.\nAeolon Morocco is located in the industrial acceleration zone of Betoya, Nador which covers an area of 50 hectares, with a total investment of about 220.8 million euros. It is expected to have an annual production capacity of 600 sets with the total employees more than 3,000 people.\nAeolon Morocco is in hiring with the positions below,', 'Recherche de nouveauté Respect des règles Besoin de réflexion Organisation', 'Maroc', '1 poste(s) sur Oujda et région', 'Méthodes / Process / Industrialisation - Secteur Electro-mécanique / Mécanique - Autres Industries', 'Méthodes / Process / Industrialisation', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +3', 'De 3 à 5 ans De 5 à 10 ans', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Respect des règles, Besoin de réflexion, Organisation, Recherche de nouveauté, Respect des règles, Besoin de réflexion, Organisation', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Respect des règles, Besoin de réflexion, Organisation, Recherche de nouveauté, Respect des règles, Besoin de réflexion, Organisation', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Non'),
(1087, 'Consultant JAVA Full Stack Anglophone-H/F | Rabat, Rabat-Salé-Kénitra, Maroc (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-consultant-java-full-stack-anglophone-hf-recrutement-dxc-technology-maroc-rabat-rabat-sale-kenitra-maroc-166440.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-20', '2025-01-20', 'Technopolis-Rabatshore , batiment B9 11100 Sala Al Jadida - Rabat', NULL, 'DXC Technology Maroc', 'DXC is the world’s leading independent, end-to-end IT services company, helping clients harness the power of innovation to thrive on change. Created by the merger of CSC and the Enterprise Services business of Hewlett Packard Enterprise, DXC Technology is a $25 billion company with a 60-year legacy of delivering results for thousands of clients in more than 70 countries.\nWith over 11 years of IT Services expertise and 1200 employees, DXC in Morocco is a Joint venture between DXC Technology and CDG Group. Our Service Center accompanies the largest institutions in the Moroccan and global markets. DXC in Morocco is based on 2 Sites : Technopolis, & Casablanca Nearshore. Our company offers a wide portfolio of end-to-end services enabling digital transformation: Datacenter, Cloud ITO, Applications, Analytics, Workplace, Business Process and Security.', 'Recherche de nouveauté Implication au travail Ambition Besoin de réflexion Besoin d\'autonomie', 'Maroc', '5 poste(s) sur Rabat et région', 'Informatique / Electronique - Multimédia / Internet - Secteur Informatique -', 'Informatique / Electronique , Multimédia / Internet', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +4', 'De 5 à 10 ans', 'Apache Camel, Apache Tomcat, HTML, Java, JavaServer Faces (JSF), JBOSS, JIRA (or similar issue tracking system), MS SQL Server, PrimeFaces, SOAP, Spring Boot, Spring Framework, SQL, SVN, REST, XHTML, XML, AWS platform offerings, Web site design experience', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Implication au travail, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Recherche de nouveauté, Implication au travail, Ambition, Besoin de réfl