pts, Advanced knowledge of dynamic tagging solutions (Adobe Tags/Launch, Adobe Event Forwarding, GTM, Firebase Analytics), Good understanding of data collection and hands on experience using AEP Mobile and Firebase Analytics SDKs, Hands-on experience creating, maintaining SDR implementations, Adobe Analytics and related Adobe Experience cloud tools expert (Adobe Experience Platform, Adobe Real-time CDP, etc.), Understanding of Adobe Analytics processing rules, SAINT classifications, report suites, Experience with digital analytics QA tools such as browser network calls, extensions (i.e. Omnibug), desktop tools (i.e. Fiddler), Hands-on experience with apps debugging tools like Charles, Assurance, Ability to own and work independently on assigned deliverables, but also collaborate with multiple team members and stake holders when necessary, Strong organizational, communications, and time management skills, Experience with other TMS (Adobe Tags, Google Tag Manager, Tealium, Ensighten, etc.), Experience with AEP Web SDK, Proficiency with building reports / dashboards with Adobe Analytics, Google Analytics 4, etc., Experience with tagging mobile apps, Familiarity with apps technologies such Kotlin, Swift, C++, AS, Xcode', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Oui 100%'),
