collaborate and engage with technical team structures and plans, Proven expertise in implementing Network project requirements, ensuring business readiness and providing business as usual support in a complex multi-tenanted Data Centre environment, Service with broad level of expertise about all technologies deployed in LAN, WAN, and SDWAN global environments., Service with expertise in implementation and management of Cisco Viptela, Service with expertise in implementation and management of Cisco ASA, Service with expertise in implementation and management of Cisco Meraki, Service with expertise in implementation and management of Cisco Catalyst, Service with expertise in implementation and management of ISE (NAC), Service with expertise in implementation and management of Wireless networks using Cisco, Service with expertise in implementation and management of Cisco DNA and other management tools, Service with expertise in implementation and management of VMWare VeloCloud, Service with expertise in automation and network management platforms, Service with Senior expertise in technical and/or operational specialist with an excellent track record in LAN/WAN and associated Security', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hybride'),
