tronique - Télécoms / Réseaux - Secteur Informatique - Telecom', 'Informatique / Electronique , Télécoms / Réseaux', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +5 et plus', 'De 5 à 10 ans', 'Understanding of IP networking fundamentals, routing & Switching, Understanding of VPN technologies: MPLS VPN, IPSEC, SSL, …, Understanding of network automation, Understanding of service orchestration engine and BPMN, Understanding of cloud environment & virtualization, Knowledge of Agile practices, tools & methodologies, Self-Motivated, self-organized, proactive & autonomous., Team spirit, good interpersonal skills., Ability to communicate clearly both written and orally., Ability to understand and synthesize multiple issues, expressed by diverse stakeholders., Assertiveness, leadership, and ability to unite., Able to step back to get a global view., Business & customer oriented.', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', 'Good knowledge of IT architecture framework including API design and API exposition framework., Knowledge of telco standards and frameworks : TOGAF, TAM, eTOM, RestAPI, Open Digital Architecture, TMF OPEN APIs, MEF APIs, CAMARA, etc.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hybride'),
