artnerships in business., New Business Launch and Growth Strategy: Successful experience in launching new businesses or business units and crafting comprehensive growth strategies to ensure sustainable development., Successful experience in launching new businesses or business units and crafting comprehensive growth strategies to ensure sustainable development., Entrepreneurial Mindset: An entrepreneurial and visionary mindset coupled with outstanding organizational and leadership skills, fostering innovation and agility., An entrepreneurial and visionary mindset coupled with outstanding organizational and leadership skills, fostering innovation and agility., Business and Financial Acumen: Familiarity with diverse business functions including marketing, public relations, finance, and other operational areas. Strong comprehension of corporate finance and adeptness in performance management principles. In-depth knowledge of corporate governance and proficiency in implementing general management best practices to ensure organizational effectiveness., Familiarity with diverse business functions including marketing, public relations, finance, and other operational areas., Strong comprehension of corporate finance and adeptness in performance management principles., In-depth knowledge of corporate governance and proficiency in implementing general management best practices to ensure organizational effectiveness., Analytical and Problem-Solving Abilities: Demonstrated analytical abilities and problem-solving skills., Demonstrated analytical abilities and problem-solving skills., Effective Communication: Excellent communication in French and English. Strong negotiation and relationship-building skills. Strong public speaking skills, facilitating transparent communication with internal and external stakeholders., Excellent communication in French and English. Strong negotiation and relationship-building skills., Strong public speaking skills, facilitating transparent communication with internal and external stakeholders., Qualifications: MSc/MA in Business Administration or a relevant field (EMBA is preferred) Bachelor degree in Engineering (Diplome d’ingénieur d’état d’une grande école d’ingénieurs is preferred), MSc/MA in Business Administration or a relevant field (EMBA is preferred), Bachelor degree in Engineering (Diplome d’ingénieur d’état d’une grande école d’ingénieurs is preferred)', 'Flexibilité, Extraversion, Organisation, Rationalisme, Implication au travail, Flexibilité, Extraversion, Organisation, Rationalisme, Implication au travail', NULL, 'Flexibilité, Extraversion, Organisation, Rationalisme, Implication au travail, Flexibilité, Extraversion, Organisation, Rationalisme, Implication au travail', 'Strategic Vision and Profitable Strategy Development: Proven expertise in developing profitable strategies and implementing visionary initiatives to enhance organizational performance., Proven expertise in developing profitable strategies and implementing visionary initiatives to enhance organizational performance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Non'),
