(2972, 'EHS Engineer | Nador (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-ehs-engineer-recrutement-aeolon-technology-co.ltd-nador-166658.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-29', '2025-01-29', 'Zone d\'accélération industrielle de BETOYA, Nador, MAROC Nador', NULL, 'Aeolon Technology co.,Ltd', 'Aeolon Technology Co., Ltd. is a leading professional manufacturer of wind power blades. At present, the company has provided innovative technology and product solutions for wind turbine operators and wind farms in many countries and regions around the world, providing high-quality, cost-effective products and customized quality services for global users. Founded in 2007, the company has set up production bases in many cities in China and in other countries (Shanghai, Jiangsu, Hebei, Gansu, Inner Mongolia, Morocco) and a R&D center in Germany. We are a leading global blade R&D, production, sales and O&M service company.\nWe are committed to the field of wind power blades, grasp the opportunity of the rapid development of the wind power industry, taking on the historical and environmental protection responsibility, focus on product quality and efficiency, striving to promote the development of clean energy.\nAeolon Morocco is located in the industrial acceleration zone of Betoya, Nador which covers an area of 50 hectares, with a total investment of about 220.8 million euros. It is expected to have an annual production capacity of 600 sets with the total employees more than 3,000 people.\nAeolon Morocco is in hiring with the positions below,', 'Recherche de nouveauté Respect des règles Ténacité Implication au travail', 'Maroc', '2 poste(s) sur Oujda et région', 'Environnement (métiers de l\') - Secteur Agriculture / Environnement - Automobile / Motos / Cycles', 'Environnement (métiers de l\')', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +2', 'De 3 à 5 ans', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Respect des règles, Ténacité, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Respect des règles, Ténacité, Implication au 