(3155, 'Consultant JAVA Full Stack Anglophone-H/F | Rabat, Rabat-Salé-Kénitra, Maroc (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-consultant-java-full-stack-anglophone-hf-recrutement-dxc-technology-maroc-rabat-rabat-sale-kenitra-maroc-166440.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-20', '2025-01-20', 'Technopolis-Rabatshore , batiment B9 11100 Sala Al Jadida - Rabat', NULL, 'DXC Technology Maroc', 'DXC is the world’s leading independent, end-to-end IT services company, helping clients harness the power of innovation to thrive on change. Created by the merger of CSC and the Enterprise Services business of Hewlett Packard Enterprise, DXC Technology is a $25 billion company with a 60-year legacy of delivering results for thousands of clients in more than 70 countries.\nWith over 11 years of IT Services expertise and 1200 employees, DXC in Morocco is a Joint venture between DXC Technology and CDG Group. Our Service Center accompanies the largest institutions in the Moroccan and global markets. DXC in Morocco is based on 2 Sites : Technopolis, & Casablanca Nearshore. Our company offers a wide portfolio of end-to-end services enabling digital transformation: Datacenter, Cloud ITO, Applications, Analytics, Workplace, Business Process and Security.', 'Recherche de nouveauté Implication au travail Ambition Besoin de réflexion Besoin d\'autonomie', 'Maroc', '5 poste(s) sur Rabat et région', 'Informatique / Electronique - Multimédia / Internet - Secteur Informatique -', 'Informatique / Electronique , Multimédia / Internet', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +4', 'De 5 à 10 ans', 'Apache Camel, Apache Tomcat, HTML, Java, JavaServer Faces (JSF), JBOSS, JIRA (or similar issue tracking system), MS SQL Server, PrimeFaces, SOAP, Spring Boot, Spring Framework, SQL, SVN, REST, XHTML, XML, AWS platform offerings, Web site design experience', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Implication au travail, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Recherche de nouveauté, Implication au travail, Ambition, Besoin de réfl