(3182, 'Directeur Recouvrement | Casablanca (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-directeur-recouvrement-recrutement-axa-credit-casablanca-166238.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-19', '2025-01-13', 'Casablanca', NULL, 'Axa crédit', 'AXA Crédit – Filiale d\'AXA Assurance Maroc\nDepuis sa création en 1954 sous le nom ACRED, AXA Crédit, filiale d\'AXA Assurance, est un acteur majeur du crédit à la consommation au Maroc. Après son acquisition en 1999 et son rebaptême en 2012, l\'entreprise s\'est rapidement développée.\nAujourd\'hui, AXA Crédit dispose d\'un réseau de 32 agences et de plus de 80 agents généraux, avec une équipe de 150 collaborateurs engagés à fournir des solutions de crédit simples et adaptées aux besoins de chaque client.', 'Organisation Besoin d\'autonomie Conventionnel Rationalisme Respect des règles', 'Maroc', '1 poste(s) sur Casablanca et région', 'Assurance (métiers de l\') - Gestion / Comptabilité / Finance - Secteur Assurance / Courtage - Banque / Finance', 'Assurance (métiers de l\') , Gestion / Comptabilité / Finance', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +4', 'De 5 à 10 ans De 10 à 20 ans', 'Un Bac +4 minimum est requis pour ce poste. Une spécialisation en gestion, finance, droit ou équivalent est un plus., Un Minimum 8 ans d’expérience dans le domaine du recouvrement, dont au moins 2 ans dans un poste de direction, idéalement dans le secteur financier ou bancaire., Solides compétences en gestion des équipes et en leadership, avec la capacité d’encadrer et de développer les compétences des collaborateurs ;, Connaissance approfondie des processus de recouvrement, des réglementations en vigueur et des techniques de négociation adaptées aux dossiers complexes ;, Maîtrise des outils digitaux de gestion du recouvrement et capacité à proposer des solutions innovantes pour améliorer l’efficacité des processus ;, Excellentes compétences analytiques permettant de prendre des décisions stratégiques pour optimiser les résultats de recouvrement ;, Grande rigueur, sens de l’éthique et une forte orientation vers la satisfaction client ;, Maîtrise parfaite du français et de l\'arabe est indispensable. La connaissance de l\'anglais est un plus.', 'Organisation, Besoin d\'autonomie, Conventionnel, Rationalisme, Respect des règles, Organisation, Besoin d\'autonomie, Conventionnel, Rationalisme, Respect des règles', NULL, 'Organisation, Besoin d\'autonomie, Conventionnel, Rationalisme, Respect des règles, Organisation, Besoin d\'autonomie, Conventionnel, Rationalisme, Respect des règles', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Non'),
(3183, 'ServiceNow Developer | Rabat (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-servicenow-developer-recrutement-cnexia-tech-rabat-166395.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-19', '2025-01-19', 'Technopolis, Bâtiment B 11 Sala-Al-Jadida 11100 Rabat', NULL, 'Cnexia tech', 'Joining Cnexia is choosing to be part of an ambitious project that values Innovation, promotes Continuous Learning and enables all tech champions to fulfill their creative dreams.\nAt Cnexia, we do more than support the clients of our world-class network and services. We develop innovative solutions and create original multiplatform media content. In fact, we’re revolutionizing how Canadians communicate on the web, interact with Mobile Apps or benefit from an AI-enhanced experience.\nProud of our status as a fully owned Moroccan subsidiary of the largest Canadian Telecom company, we have been ceaselessly growing our team since 2021. With over 1100 employees, mainly based in Fez, we have expanded in the northern region of the kingdom with our Brand-new state of the art site in Technopolis Rabat.\nIf you are ready for this challenge, we invite you to join a community that values bold ideas and professional growth all in an engaging multi cultural world-class environment.', 'As a ServiceNow Developer, your main responsibilities will be as follows:', 'Maroc', 'Rabat et région', 'Informatique / Electronique - Secteur Informatique', 'Informatique / Electronique', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +5 et plus', 'De 3 à 5 ans', 'University or college degree in engineering, computer sciences, physics, mathematics or relevant experience in an equivalent domain, Excellent communication skills in English and French, Minimum of 4+ years’ of experience with JavaScript programming, Angular, SOAP/REST, XML/HTML/CSS., Strong debugging and troubleshooting skills., Knowledge of SDLC and ITIL best practices., Commitment to continuous learning, as keeping up-to-date with the ServiceNow platform and ecosystem is crucial., Initial experience in ServiceNow development (a plus)., Familiarity with web portals using Angular JS and Bootstrap (a plus)., Understanding of Agile/Scrum methodology., Independent and autonomous thinker with a strong problem-solving mentality, capable of independently identifying and resolving challenges, Any ServiceNow certification (CSA, CAD, CIS, MC) will be considered an asset., ITIL certification.', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Oui 100%'),
(3184, 'System Integrator | Rabat (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-system-integrator-recrutement-cnexia-tech-rabat-166394.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-19', '2025-01-19', 'Technopolis, Bâtiment B 11 Sala-Al-Jadida 11100 Rabat', NULL, 'Cnexia tech', 'Joining Cnexia is choosing to be part of an ambitious project that values Innovation, promotes Continuous Learning and enables all tech champions to fulfill their creative dreams.\nAt Cnexia, we do more than support the clients of our world-class network and services. We develop innovative solutions and create original multiplatform media content. In fact, we’re revolutionizing how Canadians communicate on the web, interact with Mobile Apps or benefit from an AI-enhanced experience.\nProud of our status as a fully owned Moroccan subsidiary of the largest Canadian Telecom company, we have been ceaselessly growing our team since 2021. With over 1100 employees, mainly based in Fez, we have expanded in the northern region of the kingdom with our Brand-new state of the art site in Technopolis Rabat.\nIf you are ready for this challenge, we invite you to join a community that values bold ideas and professional growth all in an engaging multi cultural world-class environment.', 'As a System Integrator, your main responsibilities will be as follows:', 'Maroc', 'Rabat et région', 'Informatique / Electronique - Secteur Informatique', 'Informatique / Electronique', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +5 et plus', 'De 3 à 5 ans', 'University or college degree in engineering, computer sciences, physics, mathematics or relevant experience in an equivalent domain, Excellent communication skills in English and French, Minimum of 4+ years’ of experience in System Integration Telcom, Understanding of network access tools ( telnet,sftp etc), Experience with Database and Webserver connection setups, knowledge of SQL/NonSQL, A strong background on how the overall systems work end to end from Infrastructure (H/W & OS) to Database (Oracle), to Java (JVM) and webservers, to ensure high throughput is maintained is essential.', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Oui 100%'),
(3185, 'Frontend Developer | Rabat (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-frontend-developer-recrutement-cnexia-tech-rabat-166393.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-19', '2025-01-19', 'Technopolis, Bâtiment B 11 Sala-Al-Jadida 11100 Rabat', NULL, 'Cnexia tech', 'Joining Cnexia is choosing to be part of an ambitious project that values Innovation, promotes Continuous Learning and enables all tech champions to fulfill their creative dreams.\nAt Cnexia, we do more than support the clients of our world-class network and services. We develop innovative solutions and create original multiplatform media content. In fact, we’re revolutionizing how Canadians communicate on the web, interact with Mobile Apps or benefit from an AI-enhanced experience.\nProud of our status as a fully owned Moroccan subsidiary of the largest Canadian Telecom company, we have been ceaselessly growing our team since 2021. With over 1100 employees, mainly based in Fez, we have expanded in the northern region of the kingdom with our Brand-new state of the art site in Technopolis Rabat.\nIf you are ready for this challenge, we invite you to join a community that values bold ideas and professional growth all in an engaging multi cultural world-class environment.', 'As a Frontend Developer, your main responsibilities will be as follows:', 'Maroc', 'Rabat et région', 'Informatique / Electronique - Secteur Informatique', 'Informatique / Electronique', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +5 et plus', 'De 3 à 5 ans', 'University or college degree in engineering, computer sciences, physics, mathematics or relevant experience in an equivalent domain, Excellent communication skills in English, Minimum of 4+ years’ of experience with NextJS, Node.JS, ReactJS, TypeScript, and JavaScript; AWS platform engineering experience., Proven experience with version control systems such as Git; Gitlab. Well versed in DevOps and building / using Ci/CD pipelines. Experience with SaaS platforms like Uniform, ContentStack is prefered., Experience with Agile/DevOps methodologies and related tools, including Confluence and JIRA, Strong understanding of web development principles, including HTML, CSS, and responsive design, Experience with testing frameworks for front-end applications., Strong problem-solving and analytical skills, Experience with accessibility best practices and WCAG guidelines. You should have a strong understanding of accessibility best practices and WCAG guidelines, and be able to develop web applications that are accessible to all users., Experience with performance optimization techniques for web applications. You should have experience with performance optimization techniques for web applications, and be able to identify and address performance bottlenecks., Experience with front-end build tools such as Webpack or Parcel. You should have experience with front-end build tools such as Webpack or Parcel, and be able to configure and maintain build processes for front-end applications., Experience with cloud platforms such as AWS or Azure. You should have experience with cloud platforms such as AWS or Azure, and be able to deploy and manage web applications in the cloud., Experience with design systems and component libraries. You should have experience with design systems and component libraries, and be able to contribute to the development and maintenance of these systems., Experience with user research and usability testing. You should have experience with user research and usability testing, and be able to gather user feedback and iterate on designs based on that feedback., Experience with container as a service platforms (CaaS) like Kubernetes and Red Hat Openshift . You should have experience running web applications running in containers, Experience with single sign on approaches and protocols such as OIDC and SAML. You should be able to integrate the web application to different IDP’s following industry standards for SSO, Experience with SQL and NOSQL database queries. You should be able to integrate a web application to standard SQL (mysql, etc.) or NOSQL (redis, mongodb, Cassandra, etc.) databases, Experience with cross-browser compatibility testing. You should have experience with cross-browser compatibility testing, and be able to ensure that web applications function correctly across different browsers and devices.', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', NULL, 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail, Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin de réflexion, Besoin d\'autonomie, Implication au travail', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Oui 100%'),
