(3404, 'Senior Scientist in Metallurgical Processes | Benguerir (Maroc)', 'https://www.rekrute.com/offre-emploi-senior-scientist-in-metallurgical-processes-recrutement-um6p---universite-mohammed-vi-polytechnique-benguerir-166039.html', 'Rekrute', '2024-11-06', '2025-01-06', 'Lot 660, Hay Moulay Rachid, Ben Guerir 43150', NULL, 'UM6P - Université Mohammed VI Polytechnique', 'Mohammed VI Polytechnic University is an institution dedicated to research and innovation in Africa and aims to position itself among world-renowned universities in its fields The University is engaged in economic and human development and puts research and innovation at the forefront of African development. A mechanism that enables it to consolidate Morocco’s frontline position in these fields, in a unique partnership-based approach and boosting skills training relevant for the future of Africa. Located in the municipality of Benguerir, in the very heart of the Green City, Mohammed VI Polytechnic University aspires to leave its mark nationally, continentally, and globally.', 'Recherche de nouveauté Ambition Besoin d\'action Besoin d\'autonomie Rationalisme', 'Maroc', '1 poste(s) sur Marrakech et région', 'Gestion projet / Etudes / R&D - Secteur Enseignement / Formation', 'Gestion projet / Etudes / R&D', 'CDI', NULL, 'Bac +5 et plus', 'De 3 à 5 ans', 'PhD in Materials Science, Chemistry, or Physics, Strong background in metallurgical processes and their optimization, Extensive experience with materials characterization techniques and quality control, including both destructive and non-destructive methods, More than 3 years of experience in the metallurgical industry, particularly within an R&D team focused on steelmaking processes, Proven experience leading R&D projects, including planning, execution, and dissemination of results, Experience in co-supervision and coordination of master’s and PhD students will be highly appreciated', 'Recherche de nouveauté, Ambition, Besoin d\'action, Besoin d\'a